{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is found, pick it up, check properties, place. Else, move randomly and avoid obstacles. list of available nodes: <Action ID = PickUpObject    /> <SubTree ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = PlaceObjectInContainer    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Action ID = MoveToRandomLocation    /> <Condition ID = IsObstacleDetected    /> <Action ID = AvoidObstacle    />",
